# Test fixtures need to override the top-level *.parquet / *.h5 / *.npz rules
# so canonical-trial input data can be committed alongside the parity tests
# (Phase 7e Task 8 - see tests/fixtures/v7_canonical/README.md).
!tests/fixtures/**/*.parquet
!tests/fixtures/**/*.h5
!tests/fixtures/**/*.npz
